  "secret-getting-1-billion-views-comedy-azfar": "<p>Join M Hadi and Ali as they sit down with Azfar Khan, a content creator with over a billion views across Join M Hadi and Ali as they sit down with Azfar Khan, a content creator with over a billion views across</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qCmr3NFFIdE\">Watch on YouTube</a></p>\n",
  "two-weeks-middle-east-school-part-3": "<p>Watch part two first: During the winter break of 2023, I went on a life-changing trip to the Middle East along with my high school senior class. This series documents the memories from the journey alongside classmates and friends. Stay up to date on</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6EblOyuUj34\">Watch on YouTube</a></p>\n",
  "building-startup-doesnt-have-be-boring": "<p>for two weeks, our team flew from around the world to the border of france, switzerland, and italy. with the trip nearly over, there were some final adventures we needed to have. watch the rest of the videos in this series:</p>\n<p>Part of sync. Crafting Magic — field notes and vlogs from building an AI video startup in San Francisco.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uge0T51DNec\">Watch on YouTube</a></p>\n",
  "two-weeks-middle-east-school-part-2": "<p>Watch the part one: During the winter break of 2023, I went on a life-changing trip to the Middle East along with my high school senior class. This series documents the memories from the journey alongside classmates and friends. Stay up to date on</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TCrVwEoOvMk\">Watch on YouTube</a></p>\n",
