  "we-launched-startup-swiss-alps": "<p>for two weeks, we&#39;re pushing to production from the peak of the french alps. join us at sync. as we envision the future of our tools, launch a new model, and go hiking in heaven. watch the rest of the videos in this series:</p>\n<p>Part of sync. Crafting Magic — field notes and vlogs from building an AI video startup in San Francisco.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bIeTQ0an_KQ\">Watch on YouTube</a></p>\n",
